  "author": "KeyFall; button data from concertina-helper by Chuck McCallum",
  "license": "MIT",
  "description": "Bisonoric Wheatstone-system C/G Anglo with an accidental row. Button data transcribed from concertina-helper (https://github.com/mccalluc/concertina-helper, layouts/30_wheatstone_cg.yaml, MIT License, (c) 2023 Chuck McCallum); it matches the layouts published by anglo-tab and anglo-piano. Bellows direction is inferred from the notes.",
